event: step.delta
data: {"index":1,"delta":{"text":" speed, and concurrency.\n\n### Memory Management and Performance\n\nThe mechanism of memory management is where these three languages diverge most","type":"text"},"event_type":"step.delta"}

event: step.delta
data: {"index":1,"delta":{"text":" drastically. Python relies on automatic memory management via reference counting and a generational garbage collector (GC). While this shields developers from","type":"text"},"event_type":"step.delta"}

